  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + dependency check">Confirm task 010's paraId-map Load-response field is available in `compose-contracts.ts`. Read S2 spike notes + design §5/§8. Output the FULL rigor-level declaration. Load `src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md` + the project CLAUDE.md.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Add + verify the UniqueID extension">Add `@tiptap/extension-unique-id` 3.28.0 to `package.json`. Verify the resolved package is `@tiptap/extension-unique-id` (MIT) and NOT `@tiptap-pro/*` (inspect the lockfile + declared license). Record the verification.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Implement the OOXML-shaped generateID">Write an 8-hex `ST_LongHexNumber` generator (`0 &lt; x &lt; 0x80000000`) and wire it as UniqueID's `generateID` so split-minted ids are valid `w14:paraId`s directly.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Configure UniqueID for paragraph (FR-10)">In `ComposeEditor.tsx`, `UniqueID.configure({ types: ['paragraph'], attributeName: 'paraId', generateID })`. Ensure the `paraId` attribute's `renderHTML` keeps it off the DOM (hidden node attribute only, FR-09).</step>
    <step order="4" name="Explicit load-time carry (FR-09)">In `docxBridge.ts`, after `setContent`, dispatch an explicit transaction that stamps each paragraph node's `paraId` from the server map (in document order). Do not rely on auto-assign for load-time ids.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Client tests">Assert: (a) after mount, paragraph nodes carry `paraId` matching the server map; (b) the rendered DOM contains no paraId attribute; (c) splitting a paragraph yields two distinct paraIds, one equal to the original, the other OOXML-shaped (`&lt; 0x80000000`); (d) the resolved dependency is `@tiptap/extension-unique-id` (MIT), not `@tiptap-pro/*`.</step>
    <step order="6" name="Build-verify">`npm run build` the shared lib (per CLAUDE.md §12 — use the project build scripts, avoid raw `npm ci`). Confirm no Pro package pulled. Update TASK-INDEX status.</step>
  </steps>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/client/shared/Spaarke.Compose.Components/src/utils/docxBridge.ts (explicit load-time paraId carry)</output>
    <output type="code">src/client/shared/Spaarke.Compose.Components/src/widgets/ComposeEditor.tsx (UniqueID config + OOXML-shaped generateID; hidden attr)</output>
